# Filter, then concentrate the brine
# Trace silica, salt and water through filtration and half evaporation, then
# repeat at twice the extensive scale. The filter retains silica while the
# salt-bearing filtrate is concentrated; doubling inputs doubles inventories.
register lv2
add v1 water 0.30L
add v1 SiO2 0.003mol
add v1 NaCl 0.020mol
new
filter v1 v2
evaporate v2 0.5
inspect v1
inspect v2
new
add v3 water 0.60L
add v3 SiO2 0.006mol
add v3 NaCl 0.040mol
new
filter v3 v4
evaporate v4 0.5
inspect v3
inspect v4
